step Light Leather to 20
  tip Light Leather is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 30, grey 40): about 19 crafts to 20, a point every craft. Each takes 3 Ruined Leather Scraps. Three Ruined Leather Scraps a craft: the beasts of the starting zones give them as you skin. Orange to 20, and the Light Leather goes into the kits next.
  craft 2881 until 20

step Skin Light Leather
  tip 34 Light Leather for Leatherworking 20-51: 53 Light Armor Kits; from your skinning on the way: 31 of 34 Light Leather. Skin 3 Light Leather (Skinning 58), then craft 45 Light Armor Kits (Leatherworking 20 to 51). The window lists the Skinning areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 2318 x34 gather Skinning 1
