step Light Armor Kit to 51
  tip Light Armor Kit is orange at 20 (yellow 30, green 45, grey 60): about 45 crafts to 51, up to 53 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Light Leather. Use the 19 Light Leather you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One Light Leather a craft; the kits sell to vendors.
  craft 2152 until 51

step Skinning 58-75: Beasts 1-15
  tip Skin from Skinning 58 to 75 for Embossed Leather Gloves: this area gives Light Leather, and the next one the rest from Skinning 75. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
