step Leatherworking recipes at 51
  tip Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Embossed Leather Gloves (from 40, 1s 50c). Also learn Camp Tent (1s): Forever's Leatherworking camp item, 5 Light Leather, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. The Camping 101: Leatherworking quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a leatherworking trainer who teaches it free.
  learn 3756
  learn 1229432

step Embossed Leather Gloves to 75
  tip Embossed Leather Gloves is orange at 51 (yellow 70, green 85, grey 100): about 25 crafts to 75, up to 26 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 3 Light Leather and 2 Coarse Thread. Forever teaches Embossed Leather Gloves from 40.
  craft 3756 until 75
  skill Leatherworking 75

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman (75-150)
section Leatherworking 75-150

step Journeyman Leatherworking
  tip Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs Leatherworking 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Leatherworking trainer teaches it: Alliance Aayndia Floralwind (Ashenvale), Emerii Tallgust (Zephras Isle), Faldron (Darnassus), Fimble Finespindle (Ironforge) and Simon Tanner (Stormwind City); Horde Arthur Moore (Undercity), Brawn (Stranglethorn Vale), Emerii Tallgust (Zephras Isle), Karolek (Orgrimmar), Krulmoo Fullmoon (The Barrens), Narv Hidecrafter (Desolace) and Tarn (Thunder Bluff). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Fine Leather Belt (from 55, 3s). 75-150 takes about 20s 50c of recipes and 67s 50c of vendor goods, plus 150 Medium Leather, 25 Elixir of Minor Agility, 281 Heavy Leather and 24 Heavy Hide to gather or buy.
  level 10
  train Leatherworking Journeyman
  learn 3763

step Leatherworking 75-150: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 70 Coarse Thread (7s), 35 Fine Thread (35s) and 51 Salt (25s 50c); about 67s 50c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby and Jillian Tanner; Orgrimmar: Felika, Shimra and Tamar).
  buy 2320 x70 nearest
  buy 2321 x35 nearest
  buy 4289 x51 nearest

step Get Elixir of Minor Agility
  tip 25 Elixir of Minor Agility for Leatherworking 75-150: 25 Nimble Leather Gloves. Alchemy: Elixir of Minor Agility. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 2457 x25 anywhere gather Alchemy 50
  auction 2457 x25

step Get Heavy Hide (Alterac Mountains)
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip 24 Heavy Hide for Leatherworking 75-150: 19 Cured Heavy Hides and 15 Guardian Gloves (5 of them for 150-225: get them all now). Skinning: beasts of level 28-40. Skin Cave Yeti, Ferocious Yeti, Giant Yeti, Hulking Mountain Lion, Mountain Lion, Mountain Yeti and Snapjaw here (level 28-40); the Skinning guide routes this. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 4235 x24 @38.2,91.9 era gather Skinning 140
  auction 4235 x24

step Get Heavy Hide (Thousand Needles)
  only NightElf
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip 24 Heavy Hide for Leatherworking 75-150: 19 Cured Heavy Hides and 15 Guardian Gloves (5 of them for 150-225: get them all now). Skinning: beasts of level 28-40. Skin Highperch Wyvern, Saltstone Basilisk, Scorpid Reaver, Scorpid Terror, Sparkleshell Snapper and Sparkleshell Tortoise here (level 28-40); the Skinning guide routes this. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 4235 x24 @78.5,59 era gather Skinning 140
  auction 4235 x24

