step Skin Heavy Leather
  tip 100 Heavy Leather for Leatherworking 150-158: 20 Heavy Armor Kits. Skin 100 Heavy Leather at the areas of Skinning 200-225, the richest in it (they give no more points), then craft 15 Heavy Armor Kits (Leatherworking 150 to 158). The window lists the Skinning areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
