step Barbaric Shoulders to 165
  tip Barbaric Shoulders is orange at 158 (yellow 170, green 180, grey 190): about 7 crafts to 165, a point every craft. Each takes 8 Heavy Leather, 1 Cured Heavy Hide and 2 Fine Thread. Use the 7 Cured Heavy Hide you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data.
  craft 7151 until 165

step Skin Heavy Leather
  tip 60 Heavy Leather for Leatherworking 165-180: 15 Guardian Gloves. Skin 60 Heavy Leather at the areas of Skinning 200-225, the richest in it (they give no more points), then craft 15 Guardian Gloves (Leatherworking 165 to 180). The window lists the Skinning areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 4234 x216 gather Skinning 200
