step Leatherworking recipes at 180
  tip Back to the Expert trainer: Nightscape Headband (from 180).
  learn 10507 npc 4212 only Alliance
  learn 10507 npc 3007 only Horde

step Nightscape Headband to 213
  tip Nightscape Headband is orange at 180 (yellow 200, green 210, grey 220): about 41 crafts to 213, up to 46 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 5 Thick Leather and 2 Silken Thread. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data.
  craft 10507 until 213

step Skin Thick Leather
  tip 168 Thick Leather for Leatherworking 213-225: 12 Nightscape Pants. Skin 168 Thick Leather at the areas of Skinning 250-275, the richest in it (they give no more points), then craft 12 Nightscape Pants (Leatherworking 213 to 225). The window lists the Skinning areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 4304 x398 gather Skinning 250
