step Runic Leather Headband to 300
  tip Runic Leather Headband is orange at 269 (yellow 285, green 295, grey 305): about 43 crafts to 300, up to 50 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 14 Rugged Leather, 10 Runecloth and 1 Rune Thread. 14 Rugged Leather and 10 Runecloth a craft: the dearest stretch. Leatherworking 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 19082 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 19082 until 300
  skill Leatherworking 300
